{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Reciprocal\" title=\"Reciprocal\">reciprocal</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234c079a77ec02bd0bb7c7fd5fbcdec63a503b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9fc5dfd32e27201f4d934f760abd5ab4d628748.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{6}{7}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\frac{7}{6}\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{3}\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"357\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Here's a cheapshot: \nObviously, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234c079a77ec02bd0bb7c7fd5fbcdec63a503b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, its reciprocal is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e8cfcc672d40dc3bc41911217db20e590a2d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{6}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"24\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/2872a72e62a64422190194ce1cc530bcbdff895c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{-1}=\\left(\\frac{3}{6}+\\frac{4}{6}\\right)^{-1}=\\left(\\frac{7}{6}\\right)^{-1}=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{6}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"374\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=